1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,734
Good morning everyone.

2
00:00:01,734 --> 00:00:05,280
Today, we will start our lesson on
fractions.

3
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:08,511
Please open your books to the first page.

4
00:00:08,511 --> 00:00:11,664
A fraction represents a part of a whole.

5
00:00:11,664 --> 00:00:17,968
If we cut a loaf of bread into four equal
pieces and eat one piece, then we have

6
00:00:17,968 --> 00:00:19,781
eaten one-fourth of it.

7
00:00:19,781 --> 00:00:24,194
Now, try to solve the first three
questions on your own.

8
00:00:24,194 --> 00:00:25,061
I will walk

9
00:00:25,061 --> 00:00:27,901
around the class and help anyone who is
stuck.

10
00:00:27,901 --> 00:00:32,717
Complete the remaining questions for
homework and bring your answers tomorrow.
